<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Artisan Mobile - Trouve ton artisan à Cotonou</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#0f0f0f;color:#fff}
header{background:#000;padding:18px 15px;text-align:center;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;border-bottom:3px solid #FFC107}
header h1{margin:0;color:#FFC107;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:1px} header h1 span{color:#fff}
.hero{padding:40px 20px;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#1a1a1a,#0f0f0f)}
.hero h2{font-size:26px;margin:0 0 10px} .hero h2 span{color:#FFC107}
.hero p{color:#aaa;margin:0 0 25px}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#FFC107;color:#000;padding:15px 28px;border-radius:50px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;margin:6px;font-size:16px}
.btn2{background:#fff}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;padding:15px}
@media(min-width:600px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr}}
.card{background:#1c1c1c;border:1px solid #2a2a2a;padding:18px 10px;border-radius:16px;text-align:center;transition:0.2s}
.card:hover{border-color:#FFC107;transform:scale(1.02)}
.card .icon{font-size:32px} .card b{display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:15px} .card small{color:#888;font-size:12px}
.search{padding:15px;text-align:center}
.search input{width:90%;max-width:400px;padding:14px;border-radius:30px;border:none;outline:none;font-size:16px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:30px 15px;color:#666;font-size:13px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><h1>Artisan <span>Mobile</span></h1></header>

<div class="hero">
<h2>La plateforme de confiance pour trouver un bon artisan à <span>Cotonou, Calavi et partout au Bénin</span></h2>
<p>Contact direct WhatsApp - Sans commission</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/22997000000?text=Bonjour%20Artisan%20Mobile%2C%20je%20cherche%20un%20artisan%20à%20Cotonou">📲 Chercher sur WhatsApp</a>
<a class="btn btn2" href="inscription.html">👷 Inscription Artisan Gratuite</a>
</div>

<div class="search">
<input type="text" id="q" placeholder="🔍 Chercher un métier : électricien, plombier..." onkeyup="filter()">
</div>

<div class="grid" id="metiers">
<div class="card"><div class="icon">⚡</div><b>Électricien</b><small>Installation, dépannage</small></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🚿</div><b>Plombier</b><small>Fuite, robinet, WC</small></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">❄️</div><b>Frigoriste</b><small>Clim, Frigo</small></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🧱</div><b>Maçon</b><small>Construction, crépissage</small></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🪚</div><b>Menuisier Bois/Alu</b><small>Porte, fenêtre, placard</small></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🎨</div><b>Peintre Bâtiment</b><small>Intérieur, extérieur</small></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🔨</div><b>Carreleur</b><small>Carrelage, faïence</small></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">⚙️</div><b>Soudeur</b><small>Portail, grille, métal</small></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🪟</div><b>Vitrier / Alu</b><small>Vitre, baie coulissante</small></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🔧</div><b>Mécanicien Auto</b><small>Dépannage, entretien</small></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">📺</div><b>Antenniste / Électronicien</b><small>TV, parabole, son</small></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🌿</div><b>Jardinier / Paysagiste</b><small>Entretien, aménagement</small></div>
</div>

<footer>© 2026 Artisan Mobile - Cotonou, Godomey, Abomey-Calavi, Akpakpa<br>📍 Rapide - Local - Fiable - 100% Bénin</footer>

<script>
function filter(){
let v=document.getElementById('q').value.toLowerCase();
document.querySelectorAll('.card').forEach(c=>{
c.style.display=c.innerText.toLowerCase().includes(v)?'':'none';
});
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
